== P8s: algebraic status (PSLQ + symbolic verification) ==
  kappa (eta-linear): [11, 0, 0, 0, -7, 2, -1]  residual 5.3e-51
  eps (eta-linear): [-11, -11, 0, 0, 21, -6, 3]  residual 2.7e-51
  eps_eff (needs eta^2): [11, 22, 0, 0, -63, 18, -9, 36, -18, 18]  residual 5.5e-50
  (kappa: 11 kappa = eta(7 - 2 theta + theta^2) -- the defining
   relation in reduced form, verified symbolically via
   (7-2t+t^2)(2+t^2) = 11(1+t^2) mod the cubic; eps and eps_eff
   relations follow by substitution.  All residuals ~ 1e-40+:
   these are exact, NOT numerology.)
  kappa in Q(theta) (height 1e8)? None -> kappa is NOT
   algebraic in theta at low height: P7's 'transcendental-form'
